WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.542 --> 00:00:02.252
What a farm 'tastic day!

00:00:02.252 --> 00:00:03.420
Meet Otis the tractor.

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:06.047
It's time to get going and
do some crowing!

00:00:06.923 --> 00:00:10.009
Cock 'a doodle doo!

00:00:10.009 --> 00:00:13.304
Otis lives on Longhill
dairy farm.

00:00:13.304 --> 00:00:15.181
And he knows when someone
has a problem...

00:00:15.181 --> 00:00:17.684
I can't open the door.

00:00:17.684 --> 00:00:19.477
There's only one thing to do.

00:00:19.477 --> 00:00:20.061
Stop...

00:00:20.061 --> 00:00:21.396
Hit the brakes!

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:22.397
...and help!

00:00:22.397 --> 00:00:24.941
I have to get to the high jump competition!

00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:28.236
Let's get rolling!

00:00:28.236 --> 00:00:29.320
Otis!

00:00:31.072 --> 00:00:34.117
Woo hoo!
Otis, you did it! You got us out!

00:00:34.784 --> 00:00:36.536
♫ Otis! Otis! ♫ 

00:00:36.536 --> 00:00:37.912
I'm stuck!

00:00:40.123 --> 00:00:41.249
Because having a 
big heart...

00:00:41.249 --> 00:00:43.001
♫ When he feels his heart glowing ♫

00:00:43.585 --> 00:00:45.962
...means being ready
to lend a hand.

00:00:45.962 --> 00:00:47.922
I'll catch you!

00:00:47.922 --> 00:00:48.339
Ooof!

00:00:48.339 --> 00:00:50.008
♫ Together on the farm... ♫

00:00:50.008 --> 00:00:50.633
We did it!

00:00:50.633 --> 00:00:52.677
And when everyone
looks out for one another...

00:00:52.677 --> 00:00:54.345
Go Otis, go!

00:00:54.345 --> 00:00:55.054
Woo hoo!

00:00:55.054 --> 00:00:57.098
It makes this farm
even better.

00:00:57.098 --> 00:00:59.267
It's Oinks-Cellent!

00:00:59.559 --> 00:01:00.393
Can I help you get down?

00:01:01.311 --> 00:01:02.771
Thank you Otis.

00:01:02.771 --> 00:01:04.314
This wigglings got
me giggling.

00:01:06.274 --> 00:01:07.525
Help!

00:01:07.525 --> 00:01:09.486
Kevin, can you toss me
your tow line?

00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:11.946
Just keep holding
on Celeste!

00:01:12.280 --> 00:01:13.323
Let's go!

00:01:13.323 --> 00:01:14.407
I'm out!

00:01:14.407 --> 00:01:16.576
On this farm, we all help each other.

00:01:16.576 --> 00:01:19.120
That's a hundred percent
genuine farm fact.

00:01:19.412 --> 00:01:19.996
Yeah!

00:01:19.996 --> 00:01:23.082
♫ So let's get rolling with Otis ♫

